# Project Structure

This project implements various design patterns in TypeScript, organized into four main categories under the `src/` directory:

## Pattern Categories

- `architectural/`: Contains architectural patterns like Circuit Breaker
- `behavioral/`: Contains behavioral design patterns
- `structural/`: Contains structural design patterns
- `creational/`: Contains creational design patterns

## Key Files

- [package.json](mdc:package.json): Project configuration and dependencies
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json): TypeScript configuration
- [jest.config.js](mdc:jest.config.js): Jest testing configuration

## Development Tools

The project uses several development tools:
- TypeScript for type safety
- Jest for testing
- ESLint for code linting
- Prettier for code formatting

## Available Scripts

- `pnpm build`: Build the project
- `pnpm lint`: Run ESLint
- `pnpm test`: Run tests
- `pnpm format:check`: Check code formatting
- `pnpm format:fix`: Fix code formatting
